---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { STICKY_DUBAI } from '../../data/sticky-cta';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Invest in Dubai Property: Free Shortlist for Foreign Buyers"
  description="Independent Dubai property shortlist for foreign investors. Off-plan and ready units, yield-focused areas, Golden Visa from AED 2M. Licensed partner review within one business day."
  stickyCta={STICKY_DUBAI}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <span class="badge-pill mb-4">Commercial</span>
      <h1 class="mb-4">Invest in Dubai property</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        Request a vetted shortlist matched to your budget, hold period, and yield target, independent research, RERA-licensed partner handoff.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        <a href="#lead-form" class="btn-primary">Get my Dubai shortlist</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose mb-10">
      <p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Foreigners buy freehold in designated Dubai zones with 0% personal income tax on rental for most individuals. Entry from roughly AED 430K (studio, JVC-class yield areas). Budget 6 to 9% on top of price for DLD fees, agent, and registration. Golden Visa from AED 2M registered property value.</p>
      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>First-time Gulf buyers needing area and developer filtering</li>
        <li>Yield investors comparing JVC, Sports City, Business Bay, Marina</li>
        <li>Remote purchasers needing escrow and due diligence checks</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What you receive</h2>
      <p>Within one business day: 3 to 5 options with price band, gross and net yield estimate, payment plan summary (if off-plan), and links to our research on fees and visa rules.</p>
      <p>Deep dives: <a href="/guides/dubai-property-investment-guide/">Dubai property investment guide</a> · <a href="/guides/can-foreigners-buy-property-uae/">Can foreigners buy in UAE</a> · <a href="/guides/dubai-rental-yield-guide/">Rental yield guide</a></p>
      <p>Compare markets first: <a href="/gcc-rental-yields/">GCC rental yields hub</a> · <a href="/uae-business-setup-property/">setting up a company then buying</a></p>
    </div>

    <LeadForm
      title="Get your Dubai property shortlist"
      subtitle="Budget · areas · off-plan or ready"
      context="Invest Dubai property landing"
    />
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-6">Not financial or legal advice. <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
